
Getal leare: ['plus:'] betsjut: ['+'].
Getal by: ['+'] dwaan: { :x
	>> rate := 1.
	>> currency := x kwalifikaasje.
	(currency = ['euros']) ja: {
		rate := 2.
	}. <- (sels plus: (x × rate)).
}.
>> dollars := 3.
>> euros := 2.
dollars kwalifisearje: ['dollars'].
euros kwalifisearje: ['euros'].
>> money := dollars + euros.
Utfier skriuwe: money, nije-rigel.
